* ''Versions fall under no global now'' (operator, 2026-11-06: //"'No global now' applies to 'version numbers' (old web2.5 concept we discard) too."//). A version literal stands as debt to burn, never a pattern to copy; the evergreen witness counts the debt and the burn starts at the domain registry (`M6`).

